{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45552","headline":"赏牡丹应教 · 谦光","name":"赏牡丹应教","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"拥衲对芳丛，由来事不同。\n鬓从今日白，花似去年红。\n艳异随朝露，馨香逐晓风。\n何须对零落，然後始知空。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"谦光","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45552.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45552","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}